@GosubResetWitchBook Path:System/System_ResetWitchBook Version:2

@BeginIf Expression:isDebugDirectJump
    @Gosub Path:Act01_Chapter01/Act01_Chapter01_TrialInit
    @HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Duration:0 Reset:true
    @ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay

@SetTrialTimer Time:900
@HideUI UINames:ControlPanel AllowToggle:false
@ShowUI UINames:DebateUI

; ==============================================================================
; MARK: 10: 💬 レイアの反論
; ==============================================================================
; ＠ト書き▼議論シーン1-10 レイアの反論
; BGM変更：AccUhEarts(Vocal無)
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_15_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

# Judge1-10-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:私の剣を使えば<br>殺害可能だったと？<br>でもそれは他の人だろうと<br>成立するとは思わないかい？|#0101Trial10_Leia001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,55 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR5,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@PrintDebateText Text:"たとえば<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_10_01\">ホウキをたくさん繋げた</link>ら<br>どうだい？<br>犯人は現場から<br>それを<link=\"Objection_01_01_10_02\">持ち去った</link>のかも<br>しれない。<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_10_03\">剣なんて使わなくても</link><br>可能なんだ。|#0101Trial10_Leia002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:68,51 Roll:3

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そんなこと言い出したら<br>キリねーだろ。|#0101Trial10_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR5,ArmL5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:エマくんと同じく、<br>私は可能性を提示したまでさ。<br>……否定する根拠は<br>ないと思うけどね。|#0101Trial10_Leia003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,55 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:それはたしかに<br>そうかもしれませんけど……！<br>でもそもそもアリバイが――！|#0101Trial10_Hanna001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,45 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:――アリバイがなかろうと、<br>【私には不可能】だと<br>説明してあげているんだよ。|#0101Trial10_Leia004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,55 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR9,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:だいたい<br>エマくんが提示した推理も、<br>全て仮説に仮説を<br>積み重ねただけの<br>机上の空論じゃないか。|#0101Trial10_Leia005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,55 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1,ArmR5,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"私が<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_10_04\">ありあわせの物</link>で<br>槍を作ったと？<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_10_05\">私が作った証拠</link><br>もなければ、<br>そもそも<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_10_06\">そんな物が存在した証拠</link><br>すらない……。|#0101Trial10_Leia006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:69,55 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR9,ArmL8,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:証拠もなく<br>他人を疑うなんて……<br>そんなのは誰かに犯行を<br>なすりつけたい人間が<br>することなんじゃないのかな？|#0101Trial10_Leia007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,55 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR5,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:……もっと理性的に<br>なるべきだと思うよ、<br>みんな。|#0101Trial10_Leia008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:65,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1,ArmR3,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Surprised_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:それあなたが<br>言うんですの！？<br>わたくしのこと<br>散々疑ったくせにー！|#0101Trial10_Hanna002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:40,50 Roll:-4

